{"src":"fr","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":170200,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"fr","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":8328.966822,"text":"Elle est plus fine au niveau des mers et plus épaisse sur les continents."},{"kind":"text","t":8555.528478,"text":"It is thinner at sea level and thicker on the continents."},{"kind":"audio","t":8588.619992,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8593.587762000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8599.055945,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":8599.428059,"samples":3096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":17093.355435,"text":"Pendant cette période de l'histoire européenne, l'Église catholique, qui était devenue riche et puissante, a été remise en question."},{"kind":"text","t":17439.892731,"text":"During this period in European history, the Catholic Church, which had become rich and powerful, was challenged."},{"kind":"audio","t":17479.69665,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17485.094084,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":17490.207081,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17495.551776,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17500.95025,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17503.81872,"samples":22160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":330},{"kind":"input","t":24168.226553,"text":"En vous rendant au nord, ne manquez pas de visiter le superbe sanctuaire de Notre-Dame de Fatima, Temple."},{"kind":"text","t":24509.796528,"text":"When heading north, be sure to visit the magnificent sanctuary of Our Lady of Fatima, the Temple."},{"kind":"audio","t":24560.460754,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":24565.573512,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24570.912397,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24576.213962,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24581.740394,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":24582.08084,"samples":7760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":27704.070374,"text":"un lieu mondialement connu pour les apparitions de Marie."},{"kind":"text","t":27923.101587,"text":"A world-famous site known for the apparitions of Mary."},{"kind":"audio","t":27955.359192,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27960.568109,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27965.961693,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":27966.077691,"samples":3696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":34376.999407999996,"text":"Selon l'agence nucléaire japonaise, du césium et de biode radioactif ont été identifiés à la centrale."},{"kind":"text","t":34685.139824,"text":"According to Japan’s nuclear agency, cesium and other radioactive substances were detected at the plant."},{"kind":"audio","t":34733.002459999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34738.314835,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34743.462292,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":34748.809507,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34754.151230999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34758.491879999994,"samples":28760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":47450.438014,"text":"D'après la fuite, le document portera sur le différent à la frontière que la Palestine revendique sur la base des frontières existantes avant la guerre du Moyen-Orient de 19..."},{"kind":"text","t":47938.940918,"text":"According to the leak, the document will address the border dispute that Palestine claims based on the pre-19... Middle East War borders."},{"kind":"audio","t":47987.487693999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":47989.160099999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47991.004354,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47992.767089999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47994.537215,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":47995.472131999995,"samples":25160,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":370},{"kind":"audio","t":48029.763558,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48031.596591999994,"samples":23632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":53784.412554999995,"text":"La capitale de la Moldavie est Chisinau, la langue locale est le roumain mais le russe est très répandu."},{"kind":"text","t":54185.437271999996,"text":"The capital of Moldova is Chisinau; the local language is Romanian, but Russian is widely spoken."},{"kind":"audio","t":54225.749853999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54226.914807999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":54227.175773999996,"samples":10664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":54276.529158,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54278.148205,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54279.305509,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54280.016419,"samples":20496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":67092.422735,"text":"Parmi les autres nominations figurent celles du meilleur film, du meilleur réalisateur, de la meilleure cinématographie, de meilleurs costumes, du meilleur montage, de la meilleure musique originale, des meilleurs décors."},{"kind":"text","t":67660.938752,"text":"Other nominations include those for Best Picture, Best Director, Best Cinematography, Best Costumes, Best Editing, Best Original Score, and Best Art Direction."},{"kind":"audio","t":67739.536374,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67744.702141,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67749.886088,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67754.950537,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67760.20594300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67765.479018,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67770.588856,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":67774.449922,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67776.15550800001,"samples":21656,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"input","t":71125.106864,"text":"du meilleur montage sonore, du meilleur mixage et du meilleur scénario original."},{"kind":"text","t":71384.448538,"text":"Best Sound Editing, Best Mixing, and Best Original Screenplay."},{"kind":"audio","t":71426.46189600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71431.42097600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71436.83307000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71439.114468,"samples":18096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":77182.577552,"text":"Avant l'arrivée des troupes, Haïti n'avait pas rencontré de problème lié à la maladie depuis les années 1800."},{"kind":"text","t":77598.378691,"text":"Before the arrival of the troops, Haiti had not faced any disease-related problems since the 1800s."},{"kind":"audio","t":77651.845197,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77657.028374,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77662.28139,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77667.60144500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77673.041169,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77675.551903,"samples":19760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"input","t":82941.29995100001,"text":"Deux ans après la fin de la guerre, les anciens alliés sont devenus des ennemis."},{"kind":"text","t":83188.550896,"text":"Two years after the war ended, former allies turned into enemies."},{"kind":"audio","t":83231.291014,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83234.188253,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":83237.528576,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83239.35208,"samples":22296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":85203.68946200001,"text":"Et la guerre froide a commencé."},{"kind":"text","t":85337.01346300001,"text":"And the Cold War began."},{"kind":"audio","t":85379.03856100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85381.93227,"samples":23032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":90837.61502,"text":"En réalité, ce n'est pas facile du tout à trouver, même si on sait que ça existe."},{"kind":"text","t":91149.215148,"text":"In reality, it’s not easy at all to find, even though we know it exists."},{"kind":"audio","t":91185.079283,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":91190.499026,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91195.98835900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91201.300474,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"audio","t":91201.62524000001,"samples":928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":94911.57836700001,"text":"Quand on est entré dans la grotte, on est complètement isolé."},{"kind":"text","t":95108.802547,"text":"When you enter the cave, you’re completely isolated."},{"kind":"audio","t":95163.13678100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95166.376045,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95169.08636700001,"samples":25664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":104299.853437,"text":"Malheureusement, il est difficile d'étudier le flux de circulation car les comportements des conducteurs ne peuvent être prédits avec 100% de certitude."},{"kind":"text","t":104695.821865,"text":"Unfortunately, it’s difficult to study traffic flow because drivers’ behaviors cannot be predicted with 100% certainty."},{"kind":"audio","t":104766.734736,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":104771.797454,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104777.25238800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104782.78226,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104788.07845500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":104793.41529,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104798.197432,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":830},{"kind":"audio","t":104798.465289,"samples":1624,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":114221.27855100001,"text":"En 2002, Goma a été détruite par la lave du volcan Niragongo qui a enseveli la plupart des rues de la ville, en particulier le centre-ville."},{"kind":"text","t":114766.22045000001,"text":"In 2002, Goma was destroyed by the lava from Mount Niragongo, which buried most of the city’s streets, especially the downtown area."},{"kind":"audio","t":114815.23371900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114816.57322,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114818.22344700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114819.79479500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":114821.32080300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114822.97738000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":114824.642687,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114825.948548,"samples":31024,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":119723.598684,"text":"Rolando Mendoza tira avec son fusil MCS sur les touristes."},{"kind":"text","t":119941.362315,"text":"Rolando Mendoza fired his MCS rifle at the tourists."},{"kind":"audio","t":119996.509118,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119997.89737800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119999.448386,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119999.810851,"samples":14496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":127948.425353,"text":"Si vous n'avez pas l'habitude de conduire sur des routes de campagne, gardez l'esprit ouvert. Les pentes raides, les voies étroites et les courbes serrées prédominent."},{"kind":"text","t":128266.570769,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on country roads, stay open-minded. Steep slopes, narrow paths, and tight curves predominate."},{"kind":"audio","t":128311.49521600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128316.87938,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":128322.009348,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128324.36226400001,"samples":18096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"audio","t":128365.573963,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128371.23528400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128376.559829,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"audio","t":128376.831445,"samples":3696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":135472.16401399998,"text":"La plupart des télescopes de recherche moderne sont d'énormes infrastructures placées dans des régions éloignées."},{"kind":"text","t":135698.229838,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities located in remote areas."},{"kind":"audio","t":135761.127611,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135766.282628,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135771.731432,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":135776.99702699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":135781.252407,"samples":29128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":138489.21236799998,"text":"les conditions atmosphériques sont favorables."},{"kind":"text","t":138626.91627699998,"text":"The weather conditions are favorable."},{"kind":"audio","t":138684.72462199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138690.062437,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":138690.437202,"samples":7064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":145971.32723599998,"text":"Le jus de chou change de couleur en fonction de l'acidité ou de la basicité alcalinité du produit chimique."},{"kind":"text","t":146237.66746099998,"text":"Kale juice changes color depending on the acidity or alkalinity of the chemical."},{"kind":"audio","t":146283.53057499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146288.49807499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":146293.711232,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":146299.04666599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146301.734358,"samples":19528,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":152373.27585799998,"text":"C'est une bonne occasion d'admirer les aurores boréales car le ciel sera sombre pratiquement toute la journée."},{"kind":"text","t":152729.118023,"text":"It's a good opportunity to admire the auroras borealis since the sky will be dark almost all day."},{"kind":"audio","t":152776.900559,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152782.425621,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152787.65738699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":152793.11715099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":152798.596913,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":152799.19073499998,"samples":8960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":158532.186627,"text":"Il est donc probable que la notation a été ajoutée simplement comme une étiquette."},{"kind":"text","t":158771.232447,"text":"It’s therefore likely that the rating was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"audio","t":158815.316256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":158820.73361,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158825.95544599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158828.91714399998,"samples":21096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":164450.818362,"text":"Les parisiens ont la réputation d'être égocentriques, grossiers et arrogants."},{"kind":"text","t":164677.677355,"text":"Parisians are known to be selfish, rude, and arrogant."},{"kind":"audio","t":164719.33725699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164724.489285,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164730.051186,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"audio","t":164730.147465,"samples":4296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":169656.29334,"text":"Un curry est un plat à waltz d'herbes et d'épices accompagné de viande ou de légumes."},{"kind":"text","t":169986.07947099998,"text":"Curry is a dish made with a blend of herbs and spices, served with meat or vegetables."},{"kind":"audio","t":170018.76527,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170020.27789899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170021.745459,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170023.34582599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170024.14520499998,"samples":23128,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":410},{"kind":"close","t":180304.654058,"code":1005}]}